cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "optosim"
abstract: >-
  A biophysical optogenetics simulator -- Hodgkin-Huxley membrane, ChR2
  three-state photocycle, irradiance protocols -- built so that no model output
  can be mistaken for a measurement: every emitted quantity is labelled
  PREDICTED and every model constant is either cited or reported as uncited.
authors:
  - given-names: Fabio Augusto
    family-names: Sales Nogueira
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9303-8707"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fasn98/optosim"
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - optogenetics
  - channelrhodopsin
  - ChR2
  - computational neuroscience
